                                "sense_id": "5170e43e-b7db-32cd-a6ae-d4097abd60ef",
                                "text": "Since α-carbamazepine is a monotrope of γ-carbamazepine, and γ-carbamazepine is an enantiotrope of β-carbamazepine, the physical stability hierarchy depends on the transition temperature of β- and γ-carbamazepine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
